chapter.v:
For thus 


says the, 


LORD to the house of Israel: “Seek me and live;

He who 


made the, 


Pleiades and Orion, and turns deep darkness into the morning and darkens the day into night, who calls for the waters of the sea and pours them out on the surface of the earth, the LORD is his name;

Take away 


from me, 


the noise of your songs; to the melody of your harps I will not listen.
